{"v":4,"desc":"步入「Smack」的復古世界，您將在模擬街機櫃內面對一群小立方體怪物。 你的工作？ 在他們接管之前將他們擊倒！\n\n遊戲提供四個難度級別：簡單、中等、困難和超級。 每個關卡都會增加挑戰，攻擊更快、更棘手的怪物。\n\n拿起你的虛擬木槌，準備快速且準確地粉碎這些立方體。 但要小心 - 如果你猶豫，怪物就會蜂擁而至，你會很快失利！\n\n「Smack」很容易上手，但很難掌握，為任何準備好迎接立方體入侵的人提供快節奏的樂趣！","publisher":"Sabec","release":"2024-05-02","genres":["街機","桌上遊戲","派對"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/078e079d6146724595addf6c2b70882e851e20e2292dfc0977ca930095f0209a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04028abe2fb574d6421c1128673b52f630b8e0f74ca1e6a03ea401cd281cb886.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/420ac252508261b513dcde5ce8ba6b25b571699c6ba1803a0f85a1134519587e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1af5f74b7aeafcb6e0385e4d98ebf29b3eb0eb8c561f62d32b590a0ed023a3af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a998adb97b94ce9b0f4f814f32f7340dcb8c9674aa542edce25dfbff01717a08.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0dd466c4c8102d44dff483a82978a428ab9778bdc270b346be289f634c41a2ca.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a0901f12a000","dlc":[]}